---
title: "accrue_interest - Interest Accrual (Scallop Lend)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_time: current_time = clock.timestamp
    q_get_time --> q_calc_elapsed: elapsed = current_time - last_accrual_time
    q_calc_elapsed --> q_check_elapsed: check elapsed > 0
    q_check_elapsed --> q_noop: elapsed == 0
    q_noop --> [*]: no-op (already accrued this timestamp)
    q_check_elapsed --> q_calc_utilization: elapsed > 0
    q_calc_utilization --> q_get_rate: utilization = total_borrows / total_supply
    q_get_rate --> q_calc_interest: borrow_rate = trilinear_model(utilization)
    q_calc_interest --> q_calc_amount: interest_factor = borrow_rate * elapsed / seconds_per_year
    q_calc_amount --> q_update_borrows: accrued_interest = total_borrows * interest_factor
    q_update_borrows --> q_update_reserve: total_borrows += accrued_interest
    q_update_reserve --> q_update_supply: protocol_reserve += accrued_interest * reserve_factor
    q_update_supply --> q_update_time: total_supply += accrued_interest
    q_update_time --> [*]: last_accrual_time = current_time

    note right of q_calc_interest
        INV-001: interest accrues continuously based on elapsed time
        INV-002: accrued_interest = total_borrows * borrow_rate * elapsed / seconds_per_year
        INV-003: total_supply increases by accrued_interest (lenders earn yield)
    end note

    note right of q_update_reserve
        INV-004: protocol_reserve receives reserve_factor portion of interest
        INV-005: exchange_rate increases as total_supply grows relative to total_market_coin
        INV-006: accrual is idempotent within same timestamp
    end note
